# Pre-1.0 (major 0) tier policy

> gitInit
> reload

# A breaking intent stays on the 0.x line
> gitCommitMsg breaking: rework the interface
> reload
> checkPrefix 0.94.0-SNAPSHOT

# A bare major is a breaking change, so it too stays on the 0.x line
> gitCommitMsg version: major
> reload
> checkPrefix 0.94.0-SNAPSHOT

# Leaving initial development is a decision stated outright
> gitCommitMsg stable: the public API is settled
> reload
> checkPrefix 1.0.0-SNAPSHOT
